%%{init: {'theme':'base','themeVariables':{'fontFamily':'Trebuchet MS, Verdana, Arial','lineColor':'#334155','signalColor':'#0f172a'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant SRC as AXI Source
    participant DUT as DUT
    participant SNK as AXI Sink
    participant CHK as Protocol Checker

    Note over SRC,SNK: Transfer occurs only on ACLK edge when TVALID=1 and TREADY=1

    SRC->>DUT: Drive TVALID=1 with TDATA/TUSER/TLAST
    DUT->>SNK: Present output TVALID=1
    SNK-->>DUT: TREADY=0 (backpressure)
    CHK->>DUT: Assert payload stability while stalled

    SNK-->>DUT: TREADY=1
    DUT-->>SNK: Accepted beat
    CHK->>SNK: Count accepted beat

    loop width*height beats
        SRC->>DUT: Next pixel beat
        DUT-->>SNK: Handshake transfer
    end

    CHK->>CHK: Verify SOF first beat and TLAST line end
